# Security contact

Private security reports are handled through the process in
[SECURITY.md](../SECURITY.md).

**Preferred channel:** GitHub private vulnerability reporting on this repository
(*Security* tab → *Report a vulnerability*). This keeps the report, the
discussion and the fix private until an advisory is published.

If that channel is unavailable to you, open a public issue whose title is
`security report - please contact me` and whose body contains **no technical
detail**. A maintainer will open a private thread.

Do not send credentials, device dumps or personal data through any public
channel.
